## Benefits
1. **Simplicity** - No complex UI, just type and chat
2. **Fast** - Quick to start, minimal overhead
3. **Familiar** - Standard terminal interface
4. **Portable** - Works anywhere with Node.js/Bun
5. **Integrated** - Uses existing OpenClaw infrastructure
6. **Flexible** - Supports all OpenClaw features (sessions, models, providers)
